      "id": "cec9c208-900e-4925-95d5-53c33c4d8def",
      "name": "Instance Follows",
      "description": {
        "content": "Managing servers which the instance interacts with is crucial to the concept of federation in PeerTube and external video indexation. The PeerTube server then deals with inter-server ActivityPub operations and propagates information across its social graph by posting activities to actors' inbox endpoints.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
